{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chenghuang-e-o152","title":"东兴诸军恃敌遁走奉独恃有以胜之","accounts":[{"id":"chenghuang-a-b2cb8d0cd3f2b299f5dd","label":"正文","text":"东兴诸军恃敌遁走奉独恃有以胜之","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7a13b19de20745857408"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0017","role":"为冠军将军封都亭侯、独曰不然彼动其境内悉许洛兵大举而来必有成规岂虚还哉无恃敌之不至恃吾有以胜之","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7a13b19de20745857408"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0128","role":"即位","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7a13b19de20745857408"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0044","role":"魏遣攻东兴者","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7a13b19de20745857408"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0033","role":"同攻东兴者","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7a13b19de20745857408"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"率军拒之、太傅","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7a13b19de20745857408"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["chenghuang-q-7a13b19de20745857408"]},"ordering_evidence":"chenghuang-q-7a13b19de20745857408","source_order":[55,356,0],"order":9928}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0033","name":"胡遵","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"santizhu-p0017","name":"丁奉","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0041","name":"诸葛恪","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0044","name":"诸葛诞","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wuzhu-p0128","name":"孙亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-7a13b19de20745857408","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-876b9e224f245867d86d","layer":"original","quote":"孙亮即位，为冠军将军〖2〗，封都亭侯。魏遣诸葛诞、胡遵等攻东兴，诸葛恪率军拒之。诸将皆曰：“敌闻太傅自来，上岸必遁走。”奉独曰：“不然！彼动其境内，悉许、洛兵大举而来，必有成规：岂虚还哉！无恃敌之不至〖3〗，恃吾有以胜之","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":355,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":110}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
